{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pumpkin Restaurant is displayed at the bottom of the screen, allowing you to run your own restaurant while taking care of other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u5206\u9694\u6761.png?t=1740908951\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hire an employee\uff1a</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Hire pumpkin men or cats as your restaurant staff. Your restaurant needs waiters, chefs and <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u7ec4\u4ef6_\u56fe\u6807-\u6536\u94f6\u5458.png?t=1740908951\" />cashiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Employees have random attribute values, select employees with better attributes and assign them appropriate positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, special employees will appear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect recipes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The kitchen needs to be equipped with different types of recipes. The richer the recipes, the stronger the kitchen effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recipes can be upgraded to improve their properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the game progresses, special recipes will appear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231690/extras/\u5546\u5e97\u9875\u56fe\u7247_\u98df\u8c31_\u526f\u672c.png?t=1740908951\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Receive guests:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Customers have limited patience. If their patience runs out, they will leave the restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equipp